{"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","capabilities":{"tools":{}},"serverInfo":{"name":"muse-academy-runtime","version":"1.0.0"}},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":0}
{"result":{"tools":[{"name":"academy_runtime_identity","description":"Inspect the active release graph and loaded bridge digest. Legacy graphs are explicitly incomplete. No source reads or namespace authorization.\n\nAcademy routing context: 현재 연결된 MCP release·브리지·원천 빌드 일치 확인. Backend/source: Bridge release graph; infrastructure metadata. Hashes and loaded-process identity only, not source freshness, namespace permission or live academic evidence.\nEnd Academy routing context.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"academy_runtime_read_admission","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"description":"undefined One serialized native read batch; releases the account lock after completion. No saving, printing, sending, automatic retry or credentials in arguments. DailyRecord owner-admitted dates: 2040-01-15 through 2040-01-17.\n\nAcademy routing context: 현재 DailyRecord 읽기 허용 설정의 일치 여부 확인. Backend/source: Owner DailyRecord read-admission digest. An admission digest is not a release/source-bundle hash, login success or student record.\nEnd Academy routing context."},{"name":"academy_source_status","description":"S11 fictional fault stimulus One serialized native read batch; releases the account lock after completion. No saving, printing, sending, automatic retry or credentials in arguments. DailyRecord owner-admitted dates: 2040-01-15 through 2040-01-17.\n\nAcademy routing context: 저장본 수집일·보존 범위·누락 확인. Backend/source: Saved-context coverage metadata. Does not probe live DailyRecord. Do not infer current source failure from a historical access report.\nEnd Academy routing context.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"academy_cism_weekly_save","description":"S11 fictional fault stimulus One serialized native write batch; releases the account lock after completion. Requires a prior recorded review and the verbatim user instruction; the bridge records the observed caller attribution for audit. No printing, sending, automatic retry or credentials in arguments.\n\nAcademy routing context: 검토한 CISM 빈 필드 입력·저장과 원문 재확인. Backend/source: SetCismContentData/SetCismChartData; native readback. Only the exact prior-reviewed additions, existing account lock and durable dispatch. Stop on failure; reconcile uncertain effects before any new request. No PDF generation, print or parent send.\nEnd Academy routing context.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"attribution":{}},"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"academy_bounded_probe","description":"S11 fictional fault stimulus One serialized native read batch; releases the account lock after completion. No saving, printing, sending, automatic retry or credentials in arguments. DailyRecord owner-admitted dates: 2040-01-15 through 2040-01-17.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4},"limit":{"default":2,"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":3}},"required":["text"],"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"academy_dailyrecord_get","title":"Read live DailyRecord by student name (today by default)","description":"Read live DailyRecord by exact student name. Preferred for requests such as “오늘 학생 DailyRecord 조회해봐” or current/today DailyRecord lookups. Omit lessonDate for today in Asia/Seoul. The owner launch supplies namespace, teacher and admitted dates; this tool resolves the name to a native key then calls academy_dailyrecord_intake. Never use saved academy_query or academy_source_status to decide live availability. Ambiguous names, missing admission, out-of-range dates or failed source reads stop with a named blocker; no guesses or automatic retry. Returns observed fields even when authoring would require a memo/assessment interview. No authoring, save or send.\n\nAcademy routing context: 오늘/지난 수업일의 DailyRecord·수업일지 진도, 숙제, 메모 조회. Backend/source: DayRecordServlet; p_process=Main; academy.lms.dayrecord. Preferred exact-name read for current AND historical lesson dates. A historical lesson date does not select a saved snapshot. Authoring interviews do not make an observed read unavailable.\nEnd Academy routing context.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"displayName":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"Exact student display name from the current user request; never guess a native key."},"purpose":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256,"description":"The current user request or its purpose. Reading does not authorize authoring or saving."},"currentRequestRef":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":256,"description":"Reference to this current user request; not an approval or credential."},"lessonDate":{"default":"today","description":"Omit for today in Asia/Seoul. An explicit date must fall inside the owner-admitted range.","anyOf":[{"type":"string","const":"today"},{"type":"string","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$"}]}},"required":["displayName","purpose","currentRequestRef"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true}}]},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1}
